F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Curto PT 23K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30 \u2022 1100m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 31\/12\/2026:<\/strong> 18.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">01\/01 a 31\/01\/2027:<\/strong> 21.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini Trail PT 13K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 400m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 31\/12\/2026:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">01\/01 a 31\/01\/2027:<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 13K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 400m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 31\/12\/2026:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">01\/01 a 31\/01\/2027:<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rios e locais de partida do Poiares Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Poiares Trail 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 14 de fevereiro de 2027, em Vila Nova de Poiares (distrito de Coimbra). \u00c0s 09:00 partem o Trail Longo PT 35K e as Estafetas 35K junto ao Pavilh\u00e3o da ARSM em S\u00e3o Miguel de Poiares (com transporte em autocarro a partir do Mercado Municipal entre as 08:00 e as 08:40). \u00c0s 09:30 parte o Trail Curto PT 23K e \u00e0s 10:00 partem o Mini Trail PT 13K e a Caminhada 13K no Mercado Municipal de Vila Nova de Poiares, local onde terminam todas as provas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis acumulados e tempos limite?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra quatro provas competitivas homologadas pela FPA e uma caminhada: PT 35K (35 km com 1800m D+, tempo limite de 8 horas e barreira hor\u00e1ria aos 26,9 km \u00e0s 15:45), Estafetas 35K para equipas de 3 elementos (3 etapas de 11,5 km, 10 km e 12,1 km com 1800m D+ no total, limite de 8 horas), PT 23K (23 km com 1100m D+, limite de 6 horas), Mini Trail PT 13K (13 km com 400m D+, limite de 4 horas) e Caminhada 13K (13 km, 400m D+).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 31 de janeiro de 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em duas fases (at\u00e9 31\/12\/2026 e de 01\/01 a 31\/01\/2027): PT 35K (23,00 \u20ac \/ 26,00 \u20ac), PT 23K (18,00 \u20ac \/ 21,00 \u20ac, ou 16,50 \u20ac \/ 19,50 \u20ac para atletas ADAC), Estafetas 35K por equipa de 3 elementos (39,00 \u20ac \/ 48,00 \u20ac) e Mini Trail PT 13K ou Caminhada 13K (13,00 \u20ac \/ 16,00 \u20ac). A cada 10 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es de uma equipa, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o oferece a d\u00e9cima.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado (check-in) funciona no Centro Cultural de Vila Nova de Poiares no s\u00e1bado, 13 de fevereiro (das 18:30 \u00e0s 20:30), e no domingo, 14 de fevereiro (das 07:30 \u00e0s 09:30). O material obrigat\u00f3rio nas provas competitivas inclui dorsal vis\u00edvel, apito, telem\u00f3vel operacional, manta t\u00e9rmica, alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o de reserva e dep\u00f3sito de \u00e1gua (m\u00ednimo 0,5 L nos 35K\/23K e 0,375 L nos 13K), devendo os inv\u00f3lucros de g\u00e9is e barras estar marcados com o n\u00famero do dorsal.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Poiares Trail 2027 e o que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa de S. Miguel (ARSM) \u2013 Vila Nova de Poiares. O valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, transferes para a partida dos 35K e zonas de transi\u00e7\u00e3o das estafetas, pr\u00e9mio finisher, banhos e refei\u00e7\u00e3o quente no final do evento.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Poiares Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-14\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Vila Nova de Poiares, Coimbra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Poiares\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Poiares Trail 2027 realiza-se a 14 de fevereiro em Vila Nova de Poiares (Coimbra). Provas de 35 km, Estafetas, 23 km, 13 km e Caminhada. Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-poiares-trail.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo PT 35K\", \"price\": \"23.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/poiares-trail-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Estafetas 35K (Equipas de 3)\", \"price\": \"39.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"E